# Paired Primary Route: Skinning + Leatherworking 1-300 (WoW: Forever)
# Follows docs/MULTI_PROFESSION_RULES.md:
# - Dedicated per-combination file: guides/pairs/skinning-leatherworking.guide
# - Single-anchor sections on Leatherworking (crafting anchor) in rising
#   order so Polestar's section auto-skip and remaining-material
#   subtraction work with 0 lint warnings; Skinning trainers and skill
#   checkpoints are interleaved inside each Leatherworking bracket.
# - Every `collect ... gather Skinning <rank>` has a matching `auction`
#   goal in the same section so Mix / Gather / Buy modes all work cleanly.
# - Craft rows, thresholds and material counts are adapted from our own
#   guides/leatherworking.guide; skinning loops from guides/skinning.guide.
# - Trainers: Skinning Apprentice is Riley Peltskinner (Northshire,
#   Alliance) and Kagil (Valley of Trials, Horde); Journeyman, Expert and
#   Artisan Skinning are Balthus Stoneflayer (Ironforge) and Thuwd
#   (Orgrimmar). Leatherworking trainers match the solo guide.
# - Pristine Leather / Hide / Scale are Forever scarce bonus drops from
#   skinning (no node, no middleman crafter). They are kept as tips, not
#   collect steps, because the drop is a random bonus that the route
#   cannot count on.
# - All NPC, item, spell, and coordinate IDs are verified against the
#   Forever client data (build 1.60.1).

guide forever-professions/pair-skinning-leatherworking
title Skinning + Leatherworking 1-300
category Professions
folder Paired Routes
coords era
levels 1-60
zone Azeroth
keywords skinning, leatherworking, paired, primary, pristine leather, pristine hide, pristine scale, leather, hide, gather, craft

pitch Level Skinning and Leatherworking together from 1 to 300 and let your own kills feed every Leatherworking craft.
pro Skin every leather, hide and bonus Pristine drop you need yourself, so crafting costs almost nothing
pro Pristine Leather, Hide and Scale go straight into Forever recipes with no middleman crafter
con Uses both primary profession slots and slows your questing a little while you stop to skin

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

section Leatherworking 1-60

step Learn Skinning and Buy a Knife
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Skinning and Leatherworking take both of your primary profession slots, so decide before you learn them. Riley Peltskinner in Northshire teaches Apprentice Skinning at any character level. Buy a Skinning Knife: it only needs to sit in your bags, but you cannot skin without one. From now on, skin every beast you kill while leveling. Pristine Leather, Pristine Hide and Pristine Scale are Forever bonus drops from skinning, so hoard every one that drops: Leatherworking recipes use them directly and you will want them for later bands.
  train Skinning Apprentice npc 247227
  buy 7005 x1 nearest

step Learn Skinning and Buy a Knife
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Skinning and Leatherworking take both of your primary profession slots, so decide before you learn them. Kagil in the Valley of Trials teaches Apprentice Skinning at any character level. Buy a Skinning Knife: it only needs to sit in your bags, but you cannot skin without one. From now on, skin every beast you kill while leveling. Pristine Leather, Pristine Hide and Pristine Scale are Forever bonus drops from skinning, so hoard every one that drops: Leatherworking recipes use them directly and you will want them for later bands.
  train Skinning Apprentice npc 267327
  buy 7005 x1 nearest

step Learn Leatherworking
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Randal Worth in Stormwind teaches Apprentice Leatherworking at any character level (Adele Fielder near Crystal Lake in Elwynn, Nadyia Maneweaver in Teldrassil and Gretta Finespindle in Ironforge teach it too). Your Skinning and Leatherworking now grow together: every beast you skin supplies the bands below. Salt, thread and dyes come from the Leatherworking Supply vendor nearby.
  train Leatherworking Apprentice npc 11096

step Learn Leatherworking
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Kamari in Orgrimmar teaches Apprentice Leatherworking at any character level (Shelene Rhobart in Brill and Chaw Stronghide in Bloodhoof Village teach it too). Your Skinning and Leatherworking now grow together: every beast you skin supplies the bands below. Salt, thread and dyes come from the Leatherworking Supply vendor nearby.
  train Leatherworking Apprentice npc 5811

step Skin the Boars (Valley of Trials)
  only Horde
  zone Durotar
  tip Kill and skin Mottled Boars around the Valley of Trials until Skinning 75. Any beast up to level 10 skins at skill 1; from level 11 each level needs 10 more skill. Keep every Ruined Leather Scrap and Light Hide for the first Leatherworking band, and stash any Pristine Leather that drops.
  goto 45.9,65.4 "Mottled Boar" r 30
  goto 45.0,62.0 "Mottled Boar" r 30
  goto 42.7,61.6 "Mottled Boar" r 30
  goto 42.3,64.7 "Mottled Boar" r 30
  skill Skinning 75

step Skin the Wolves (Northshire Valley)
  only Alliance
  zone Elwynn Forest
  tip Kill and skin Young Wolves and Timber Wolves around Northshire Valley until Skinning 75. Keep every Ruined Leather Scrap and Light Hide for the first Leatherworking band, and stash any Pristine Leather that drops.
  goto 46.2,41.9 "Young Wolf, Timber Wolf" r 30
  goto 46.4,38.1 "Timber Wolf, Young Wolf" r 30
  goto 49.0,37.8 "Young Wolf, Timber Wolf" r 30
  goto 50.0,45.9 "Timber Wolf, Young Wolf" r 30
  skill Skinning 75

step Leatherworking 1-60: vendor goods
  tip Salt (20) for the Cured Light Hides and Coarse Thread (20) for the gloves, from any Leatherworking Supply vendor.
  buy 4289 x20 nearest
  buy 2320 x20 nearest

step Leatherworking 1-60: Auction House
  tip What 1-60 takes that the Auction House sells: 105 Ruined Leather Scraps and 20 Light Hide. The counts drop by what your bags, bank and mail hold.
  auction 2934 x105
  auction 783 x20

step Leatherworking 1-60: skinning
  tip Ruined Leather Scraps and Light Hides come from beasts of level 1-15, exactly the animals you skinned to 75. Take them from your bags or bank.
  collect 2934 x105 anywhere gather Skinning 1
  collect 783 x20 anywhere gather Skinning 1

step Light Leather (1-30)
  tip Light Leather, 35 to 30: 3 Ruined Leather Scraps each. This is the only Light Leather made from scraps; later bands use skinned or bought leather.
  learn 2881 "Light Leather"
  craft 2881 "Light Leather" until 30

step Cured Light Hide (30-50)
  tip Cured Light Hide, 20 to 50: 1 Light Hide and 1 Salt each. Keep all 20 for the Embossed Leather Pants at 60. Without 20 Light Hides, make 24 Light Armor Kits (24 Light Leather) to 45, then 5 Embossed Leather Gloves (15 Light Leather, 10 Coarse Thread) to 50 instead.
  learn 3816 "Cured Light Hide"
  craft 3816 "Cured Light Hide" until 50

step Embossed Leather Gloves (50-60)
  tip Embossed Leather Gloves, 10 to 60: 3 Light Leather and 2 Coarse Thread each.
  learn 3756 "Embossed Leather Gloves" npc 5564 only Alliance
  learn 3756 "Embossed Leather Gloves" npc 3365 only Horde
  craft 3756 "Embossed Leather Gloves" until 60

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Journeyman

section Leatherworking 60-105

step Journeyman Leatherworking
  only Alliance
  zone Stormwind City
  tip Journeyman Leatherworking raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and level 10. Simon Tanner in Stormwind teaches it. Learn it before the Embossed Leather Pants: they carry you to 80 but give no points past 75 without it.
  level 10
  train Leatherworking Journeyman npc 5564

step Journeyman Leatherworking
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Journeyman Leatherworking raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and level 10. Karolek in Orgrimmar teaches it. Learn it before the Embossed Leather Pants: they carry you to 80 but give no points past 75 without it.
  level 10
  train Leatherworking Journeyman npc 3365

step Journeyman Skinning
  only Alliance
  zone Ironforge
  tip Journeyman Skinning raises the Skinning cap to 150 and needs skill 50. Balthus Stoneflayer in Ironforge teaches it. Train it before you leave your 75 starter zone grind behind.
  train Skinning Journeyman npc 6291

step Journeyman Skinning
  only Horde
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip Journeyman Skinning raises the Skinning cap to 150 and needs skill 50. Thuwd in Orgrimmar teaches it. Train it before you leave your 75 starter zone grind behind.
  train Skinning Journeyman npc 7088

step Skin the Raptor Camp (Barrens)
  only Horde
  zone The Barrens
  tip Work the small raptor camp west of Northwatch Hold (Sunscale Scytheclaws, Zhevra Chargers, Ornery Plainstriders, level 16-18) until Skinning 125. Keep the Light Leather, Medium Leather and Medium Hides you loot, and stash any Pristine Hide that shows up: the Leatherworking bands ahead eat plenty of leather, and the bonus drops are scarce.
  goto 57.8,52.0 "Ornery Plainstrider, Sunscale Scytheclaw" r 30
  goto 61.1,50.1 "Sunscale Scytheclaw, Zhevra Charger" r 30
  goto 56.3,47.8 "Ornery Plainstrider, Sunscale Scytheclaw" r 30
  goto 52.5,47.1 "Sunscale Scytheclaw, Zhevra Charger" r 30
  skill Skinning 125

step Skin Boars and Bears (Loch Modan)
  only Alliance
  zone Loch Modan
  tip Elder Mountain Boars and Black Bear Patriarchs (level 16-17) roam the east side of the loch, and Loch Crocolisks skin too. Stay until Skinning 125 and keep every Light Leather, Medium Leather and Medium Hide. Stash any Pristine Hide that shows up: the Leatherworking bands ahead eat plenty of leather, and the bonus drops are scarce.
  goto 62.1,38.0 "Elder Mountain Boar" r 30
  goto 62.7,33.8 "Black Bear Patriarch, Elder Mountain Boar" r 30
  goto 57.3,32.6 "Loch Crocolisk, Black Bear Patriarch" r 30
  goto 67.2,38.0 "Elder Mountain Boar, Black Bear Patriarch" r 30
  skill Skinning 125

